# Block accidental customer-data commits from this folder.
# Keep only governance templates, schemas, and sanitized examples in Git.

*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!privacy-notice-template.md
!intake-checklist.md
!customer-profile.schema.json
!customer-profile.example.json
!deletion-request-template.md

